    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n** VIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE **\n\nApt. 1 Maritimo presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a two bedroom, two bathroom first floor apartment in one of Galway's most sought after coastal locations. Ideally positioned overlooking the famous Salthill Prom. The property provides well proportioned accommodation, with two generous bedrooms and two bathrooms, making it an ideal purchase for owner-occupiers, a superb city base or an attractive investment opportunity.\n\nThe location is undoubtedly one of the property's greatest attractions. With the Salthill Promenade practically on the doorstep. Salthill village is within easy reach and offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, pubs, shops and everyday amenities. Along with easily accessible outdoor amenities, Leisureland is nearby, offering swimming pools, a gym and golf course. Galway Atlantaquaria is also close by, while Salthill Beach, Blackrock Diving Tower and the various beaches along the promenade provide plenty of opportunities to enjoy the outdoors.\n\n\nFeatures:\n- c.730 square feet of living space\n- Electric storage Heating\n- 3,840.70 Mangement fee per annum\n- Unrivalled location\n- Walking distance to Galway City Centre\n- Private south east facing balcony\n- Sea views\n\nDNG Leonard & Heaslip for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice that: (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) Any intending purchasers or tenants must not rely the descriptions, dimensions, references to condition or necessary permissions for use and occupation as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of DNG Leonard & Heaslip has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development. DNG Leonard & Heaslip accept no liability (including liability to any prospective purchaser or lessee by reason of negligence or negligent misstatement) for loss or damage caused by any statements, opinions, information or other matters (expressed or implied) arising out of, contained in or derived from, or for any omissions from this brochure."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.5m x 1.0m\nCarpet flooring\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.2m x 4.1m\nCarpet flooring, frosted window\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 0.9m x 2.9m\nFully tiled, Stand alone shower, WC, WHB\n\nBedroom Two - 4.1m x 3.2m\nLaminate flooring, sliding door to balcony\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 6.8m x 4.3m\nLaminate flooring, built in kitchen with electric appliances, TV point\n\nBathroom - 2.0m x 2.5m\nFully tiled, bath/shower, WC, WHB\n\n"
